      "en": "James, a servant of God and of the Lord Jesus Christ, to the twelve tribes which are in the Dispersion: Greetings.",
      "ko": "하나님과 주 예수 그리스도의 종 야고보는 흩어져 있는 열 두 지파에게 문안하노라",
      "source_text_hash": "d9016b1cdbf94a1a8ff8febbfef9f003d824caacf88b279add503b19539bf51f",
      "translation_text_hash": "d2876c595034cd0fe1c2c52bf3abc989d04b0d90bd003444b58250d3ed2426b6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
