      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JAS",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "For that man shouldn’t think that he will receive anything from the Lord.",
      "ko": "이런 사람은 무엇이든지 주께 얻기를 생각하지 말라",
      "source_text_hash": "d3d05689b91bad0ed8e128f433b0c568342e9910d6478729b83b9202bc147f81",
      "translation_text_hash": "c22d87430aa37cb706492722ea41a89d643bc0ed20cb5bc271361e01124c08e3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이런 사람은 무엇이든지 주께 얻기를 생각하지 말라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c22d87430aa37cb706492722ea41a89d643bc0ed20cb5bc271361e01124c08e3"
      ]
    },
    {
